// Script tests (lim test runs them). Each test plays from New Game without a screen and checks how it ends for the choices made.
// See "Script tests" in https://liminalia.skyta.dev/en/docs/design/format/. The text to choose is the option's text, or part of it.

# Looking through the telescope and making a wish gets the lens cap
choose Look through the telescope
choose Go outside and look up
choose Try making a wish
expect game.looked && game.wished
expect text "lens cap"
expect reach epilogue#dawn
expect no-errors

# Making a wish without looking through the telescope gets a bell from the door
choose Go outside and look up
choose Try making a wish
expect !game.looked && game.wished
expect text "took one of the bells off the door"
expect not text "lens cap"

# Watching in silence leaves the door open
choose Go outside and look up
choose 2
expect !game.wished
expect text "left the door open a little"
expect reach epilogue#dawn
